    skos:prefLabel "Lucas Jackson"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Educator, facilitator, and certified Warm Data host based in Vermont; trained through the International Bateson Institute's Warm Data host program in 2020. Limited independent verification beyond the show's own detailed bio and the International Bateson Institute's own certified-host program — real per multiple internally-consistent sources, but less independently documented than Nora Bateson or Jonathan Goldsmith, honestly flagged as such."@en ;
